@page "/"

<PageTitle>Sanity.Client Blazor sample</PageTitle>

<h1>Sanity.Client Blazor WASM sample</h1>

<p>
    This app demonstrates the <code>Sanity.Client</code> SDK being used from
    a Blazor WebAssembly app via dependency injection.
</p>

<p>
    See the <a href="movies">Movies</a> page for a live GROQ query against
    Sanity's public demo dataset.
</p>

<p>
    Connection settings live in <code>wwwroot/appsettings.json</code> under
    the <code>Sanity</code> section, and are registered in
    <code>Program.cs</code> via <code>builder.Services.AddSanityClient(builder.Configuration)</code>.
</p>
